==English==

===Noun===
'''jewels'''

== Etymology ==
The etymology of Jewels is the same as the in jewel, from the [[Latin]] word [[jocus]], also pronounced as iocus.  



== More about the word ==
# Plural of [[jewel]]. 
Jewels are [[gemstones]] that are used for [[crowns]] and special items. Many people make their [[value]] important. If you'd like to learn more on the topic of the word jewels, go to [[rocks]] or [[mineral]].

 

